5306: SOURCE and tests neither, so both exits are the `idata == k` shape.  The swap reading was rejected on its
5307: own consequence: it makes `rd == 0` floor only because `crn == 0` happens to dominate -- had the arm been
5308: `crn 4`, `rd == 4` would be floor and `rd == 0` not.  **Grading by coincidence is the same vice as
5309: grading by cost, and my own provisional lean ("floor, because one cheap row pins each") was that vice;
5310: it is overturned.**  THE RULE THE NEXT PURE DELETION INHERITS, when its guarded body tests nothing: the
5311: floor is clause (b)'s verbatim reinstatement plus the dominating predicates' accept cell; every
