5318: keyed on `rd == k` for an undriven k, or on an exact inten VALUE, is not pinned — the body indexes by
5319: `rd` and copies inten, and tests neither; an exit keyed on `isteer != 0` is EQUIVALENT on this
5320: instrument (isteer can only become non-zero through a write that itself exits); no session makes more
5321: than five inten reads; the ANCHOR rows raise only irq 28.
5322: 
