5324: HOST DEATH at the read, not through its named "spins, 0x18 never reached" channel; and `D_RESET` /
5325: `D_ZERO` cannot vary under a wrong-source mutant whose substitute is also zero (isteer, isrc and tmr0 are
5326: all 0 in a stepped session) -- they earn their place against the reinstatement class, not that one.
